  - id: paddle.dragonruby
    title: DRAGON RUBY
    description: "R\u1ED3ng ph\u01B0\u01A1ng \u0110\xF4ng ch\u1EA1m n\u1ED5i tr\xEAn m\u1EB7t s\u01A1n m\xE0i \u0111en. Th\xE2n r\u1ED3ng h\u1ED3ng ng\u1ECDc qu\u1EA5n quanh c\xE1n b\u1ECDc da, \u0111\u1EA7u r\u1ED3ng s\u1EEBng v\xE0ng ng\u1EF1 \u1EDF chu\xF4i."
    collection: ELITE COLLECTION
    tokenpadPrice: 0
    elitePrice: 800
    previewPrefab: {fileID: 6843590692752793546, guid: e23073bbbab390349bbe706b9033e9b6, type: 3}
    gameplayPrefab: {fileID: 4128654114569838224, guid: 46fd74f54083cab45a833a80e134cba4, type: 3}
    thumbnail: {fileID: -7541759722041312375, guid: 8c4035999a81db449b36d50947685b30, type: 3}
    gemstone: 1
    effectTitle: "X\xCDCH LONG TRUY CH\xC2U"
    effectDetails: "\u0110\xE1nh tr\xFAng b\xF3ng, r\u1ED3ng \u0111\u1ECF lao ra t\u1EEB m\u1EB7t v\u1EE3t v\xE0 \u0111u\u1ED5i theo b\xF3ng.\nTh\xE2n r\u1ED3ng u\u1ED1n l\u01B0\u1EE3n theo \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng s\xF3ng h\xECnh sin, k\xE9o theo v\u1EC7t l\u1EEDa \u0111\u1ECF v\xE0 d\u1EA3i v\xE0ng \u0111\u1ED1i x\u1EE9ng.\nB\xF3ng h\xF3a vi\xEAn ng\u1ECDc r\u1EF1c s\xE1ng; \u0111\u1EA7u r\u1ED3ng g\u1EA7m c\xF9ng v\xF2ng l\u1EEDa b\xF9ng l\xEAn t\u1EA1i \u0111i\u1EC3m ch\u1EA1m.\nCh\u1EC9 xu\u1EA5t hi\u1EC7n sau c\xFA \u0111\xE1nh c\u1EE7a ng\u01B0\u1EDDi c\u1EA7m v\u1EE3t n\xE0y, khi thi \u0111\u1EA5u v\xE0 luy\u1EC7n t\u1EADp. \u0110\u1ED1i th\u1EE7 \u0111\xE1nh tr\u1EA3, r\u1ED3ng tan th\xE0nh tro l\u1EEDa."
    releaseOrder: 3
  defaultPaddle:
